=head1 NAME

_READ_EXTENSION_ - Read one (or more) extension(s) from a file

=head1 DESCRIPTION

Reads the specified extension(s) from the given file.

Each extension is returned via the primitive hash:

    _READ_EXTENSION_ FILE=$in EXTENSION=ACSIS

    my $acsis = $_READ_EXTENSION_{'ACSIS'};

=head1 ARGUMENTS

=over 4

=item B<FILE>

The file from which to read the extension.

=item B<EXTENSION>

Name of the extension(s) to read.  Can be a comma-separated
list or array reference.

=back

